        "diagram": "articles_map",
        "points": [
          "You know **a / an** (one thing) and **the** (this one).",
          "English also uses **nothing** — no article — for a whole group, or an idea.",
          "Czech has no article, so *the* appears where English wants zero."
        ],
        "table": {
          "headers": ["", "Say"],
          "rows": [
            ["one dog", "**a** dog"],
            ["this door / the only sun", "**the** door · **the** sun"],
