          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "A group, or an idea",
        "title_cz": "Skupina, nebo idea",
        "text_first": true,
        "points": [
          "*I like the dogs* = some specific dogs. For the animal in general: **I like dogs.**",
          "*The life is hard* is not English. **Life is hard.**"
        ],
        "table": {
          "headers": ["Not", "Say"],
